      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Sure, happy to help. Under GDPR, you must ensure customer consent before collecting their email addresses or shipping info. Make this consent explicit, clear, and easily withdrawable. Store this information securely and ensure it's only used for the purposes you stated when collecting it. During an audit, you would need to show evidence of obtaining consent and demonstrating how you’ve protected this data thoroughly.",
